{"title":"1998 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 25","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Two natural numbers, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/b/34b2864f06b4e50859a0bea1a812d50a2154547b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"13\" height=\"11\" /> do not end in zero. The product of any pair, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/b/34b2864f06b4e50859a0bea1a812d50a2154547b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"13\" height=\"11\" /> is a power of 10 (that is, 10, 100, 1000, 10 000 , ...). If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/b/a5b6051ac0a556f98f7481e62093ba35754d8805.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p &gt; q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"44\" height=\"15\" /> , the last digit of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/f/a1f8131b9cef2c23369011c1cbc425f2861c026e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p-q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"42\" height=\"16\" /> cannot be\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/3/0b324531c4e9aa97effe0399a23e0369c7a04803.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 1 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 3 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 5 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 7 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"330\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If the product <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/c/79ccffd0d1686be982eed9fdcb75f35551e8cb3a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$pq$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"18\" height=\"11\" /> is a power of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/7/517151f6f181bc7bcbfe164ac5c211c84abc0e92.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"22\" height=\"16\" /> and both <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/1/0615acc3725de21025457e7d6f7694dab8e2f758.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> do not end in 0, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> must be in the form <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/2/5b216498b4cb64f29f3bfdfa60736dc769f06c7d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5^n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/1/0615acc3725de21025457e7d6f7694dab8e2f758.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> must be in the form <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/2/3d2f361af88bb8a3dab73e1ea046061b0014ac7e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^n.$\" width=\"21\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p>We know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/f/1cfb10998ee55af0e830eef8034cea1dbf5a45d6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5^n \\equiv 5 \\pmod {10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"135\" height=\"20\" /> for all positive integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/f/71f8cdb9e4d1d8be8b91e8fcd88d27ebd5bf1143.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^n \\not\\equiv 0 \\pmod {10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"135\" height=\"20\" /> for all integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />.\n</p><p>Therefore, we know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/9/829ada94870e8a5fa327ead226e87762bf9e9352.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p - q \\not\\equiv 5 - 0 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ 5}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"190\" height=\"30\" />\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)\" title=\"1998 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7)\">1998 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7)</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems\" title=\"1998 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Answer_Key\" title=\"1998 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1998 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 24\">Problem 24</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b>Last Problem</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1998 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_2\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"1998 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1998 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1998 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1998 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1998 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1998 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1998 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1998 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1998 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1998 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Gauss_